  "return {k:\"appauth\",t:\"This Revizto account isn’t authorised for MCP yet\",d:\"Two things cause this, and the first is yours to fix. (1) This organisation account hasn’t been authorised for the connector you signed in with — the Revizto MCP can only reach accounts covered by your most recent authorisation, so an estate spanning several accounts needs each one authorised. Do it in Revizto Workspace → your profile → Active sessions → API, then press Re-check. (2) If it still fails, the Revizto MCP Server app isn’t activated on that account — an owner or admin activates it under Manage account info → Developer portal (standard users see Account info → App integrations). Until one of those is done, this account’s licences can’t be read.\"}": 1,
